gree with we.","D":"Were changes the time to past."}}},{"id":"f6c42459-088c-5370-a24f-10e744f60e36","topicSlug":"question-tags","level":"B1","prompt":"“Let’s measure the garden fence, ____?”","choices":[{"id":"A","text":"aren’t we"},{"id":"B","text":"did we"},{"id":"C","text":"shall we"},{"id":"D","text":"do we"}],"answerId":"C","hint":"Recognise the special **let’s … shall we?** pattern.","explanation":"The usual tag after a shared suggestion with **let’s** is **shall we**.","keywords":["suggestion-tag"],"skill":"suggestion-tag","contextKey":"question-tags-3","fingerprint":"3f4e133ec351a43b5cdf8e27f6fbc91e7879d51b958b236e472dc61fae619113","source":"seed","provenance":{"kind":"original-guidance-aligned","referenceIds":["bc-question-tags"],"version":"core-2026-09-v3","reviewStatus":"automated-checked; educator-review-pending"},"teaching":{"steps":["Recognise the special **let’s … shall we?** pattern.","The usual tag after a shared suggestion with **let’s** is **shall we**.","Choose **shall we**. Read the complete sentence again and check both its form and its intended meaning."],"choiceReasons":{"A":"The clause has no be construction to match.","B":"A past tag does not fit this present suggestion.","C":"The usual tag after a shared suggestion with **let’s** is **shall we**.","D":"Do we is not the usual let’s suggestion tag."}}},{"id":"d0061fca-0f6f-52d3-a24a-8321a8e56215","topicSlug":"question-tags","level":"B1","prompt":"“She translates the travel leaflet every week, ____?”","choices":[{"id":"A","text":"isn’t she"},{"id":"B","text":"don’t she"},{"id":"C","text":"doesn’t she"},{"id":"D","text":"does she"}],"answerId":"C","hint":"Find the tense, subject and positive polarity; then build the **negative matching tag**.","explanation":"The positive present-simple statement with she takes negative **doesn’t she**.","keywords":["positive-present-tag"],"skill":"positive-present-tag","contextKey":"question-tags-4","fingerprint":"f7e9df8cffff16365701608afae2f9f671cb6f0373ad51